{"server":"cn","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_03_end","groupId":"act47side","stageId":"act47side_03","title":"跌落保护","storyCode":"UR-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act47side/level_act47side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"b67bee4c6435ee31fd1b3921111fd0b8bba6a66d3b3b6a67f8f13d1d3249d869","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"68_g5_floatingstation"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"优胜劣汰，园区准则......莱茵什么时候也被归到淘汰者的队伍里了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......呃，斯凯先生？你怎么在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这话应该我来问吧？“幸运瘤兽”应该已经办完进驻资质注销手续了，你在这儿干嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有利用任何非法途径！在注销进驻资质前，我们靠自己解决了技术难题，实在太幸运了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解决了？为什么没有人通报工程部？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是事出突然，交接上出了问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再、再说了，刚刚高登长官都在广播里通报了——莱茵生命主导的工程检修全面暂停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，我也不需要向你汇报了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三天都没法解决的问题，突然就搞定了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸运的“幸运瘤兽”吗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"68_g6_floatinglabmodule"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快点，读数，快点！他们的人指不定什么时候就回来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......数据完全达标。不如说达标得有点太精准了，简直像是对着标准刻意调整过一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这几个......不是园区通用的螺丝型号吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拧不动。完全焊住了......整个核心动力装置都被封死了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我听也能听出来，园区允许使用的动力元件里，没有任何一个型号的能发出这种声响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是从哪搞来的这种不合规的奇怪元件？园区所有零件的采购权不是都归——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......原来是这样，我还以为园区的准则真的是优胜劣汰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......忙着帮那个混蛋整理莱茵的事故报告吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，就算上报给娜斯提主任，她也会质疑我没有证据。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有谁能帮我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g9_headquarter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的车还有五分钟到。要是实验园区有吉祥物玩偶，我会给你带一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不是需要人哄的小孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那再见？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"你从塞雷娅办公室出来之后，就一直待在走廊里跟你的“树枝”玩抛接球。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"故意拖延时间不见我？我都看到了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利用水分身侵犯个人隐私应当被追究法律责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"在哥伦比亚出现第二个水精灵之前，你无处申诉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"话音刚落，娜斯提腰间的“树枝”突然向上伸长了一截，枝端对准水精灵的方向，旋开工具片。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"缪尔赛思像排练了无数次一般朝右移了一步，躲开仿生树枝机器人的恶作剧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"真过分，你明知道我现在在谢拉格，不可能亲自来送行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"远距离维持水分身对你的消耗不小，这么担心我搞砸克丽斯腾的遗产？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我担心的不是万星园后续项目的实验进度，而是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"种子长成树苗尚且需要时间，更何况你希望它能长成参天巨木。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"放轻松点，连斐尔迪南都不会对你目前的成果挑三拣四。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是因为我屏蔽了他的邮箱地址。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"在特里蒙郊外的地下，你偷偷帮着克丽斯腾实现她的梦想，现在终于轮到你自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"娜斯提，你有没有想过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会回河谷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"河谷的安宁不属于一个残缺的女妖，也无法为她带来灵感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我该走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，给。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盆栽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"它是我们生态科在荒漠挖到的，耐寒耐旱，跟你一样倔......就当是我送你的饯别礼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"不用放进生态箱，只要记得浇水就行，它会替我好好“监视”你的，说不定也会帮到你哦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"作为回礼，你只要照顾好生态园和你自己，还有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"要是园区商品部真出了吉祥物玩偶，记得一定要给我带一个！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"资深研究员","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主任，一楼生态箱内的枯枝已经全部清理好了，这盆盆栽是展区里唯一存活的植物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地下区域的“植物”状况如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"资深研究员","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回传数据跟预想中一样，但监测信号覆盖不全，我们还没时间派人下去确认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去吧，辛苦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地下研究员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜斯提主任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有没有外人来过地下实验室？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地下研究员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，我们一直在这里模拟实验环境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，以防万一......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（萨卡兹语）显形。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有其他人来过的痕迹......真的是意外？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地下研究员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主任，枯死植株的所有数据已经整理成了分析报告，您现在要确认吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电子声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"娜斯提·鲁诺瑞伊，工程科主任，确认权限，已开启。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"68_g4_floatingplatform"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园区警卫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，那两个家伙跑哪儿去了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"体验员","speakerId":"avg_npc_2044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警卫先生，发生什么了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园区警卫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园区警卫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位放心，我们只是受高登长官指示，模拟未来在影月上执行任务的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园区警卫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论身处何方，哥伦比亚都会无条件保障公民的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园区警卫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（分头找，记得低调行事。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园区警卫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"体验员","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来真的是模拟演习......跟蓝卡坞大片《影月争霸》里的桥段一模一样！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_4214_cairn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没骗你吧？那些警卫就是卡西米尔太空骑士，你可千万要掩护好我们啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别打哈哈了，冒牌货。接下来我们应该往哪儿跑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_4214_cairn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"飞天甜甜圈站的藏身之处不多，后面的环形廊道又容易被埋伏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们难道出去送死？我俩可是签了旅行社合约的，你必须把我带出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_4214_cairn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别着急，正牌货。这儿可是“螺旋桨天堂”，忘掉地面上的逻辑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_4214_cairn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你正在测评的是沃尔沃特科钦斯基的滞空跳板对吧？借我们一用？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"体验员","speakerId":"avg_npc_2044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园区警卫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？什么声音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园区警卫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快抬头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园区警卫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，他们怎么跑到浮空舱顶上去了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我怎么忘了，在“螺旋桨天堂”，所有人都是会抬头看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那现在怎么办！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园区警卫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把他们给我炸下来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"体验员","speakerId":"avg_npc_2044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦——这是在模拟电影高潮段落反派使用的空气炮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"体验员","speakerId":"avg_npc_2044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，这是源石火药的味道......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园区警卫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开火！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"跑啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"68_g8_gordoncollection"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个两个都是废物！好不容易摁住了莱茵，又跑了一个不安分的导游......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是接下来还有生意要做，我一定亲自去把那个菲林逮回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太空鳞兽","speakerId":"avg_npc_2040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“天空征服者”，要不要我替你解决那些愚昧的泰拉人，让他们见识一下来自外泰拉的绝对力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时不用，零五四。一个导游而已，又不是特工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先汇报古斯塔夫的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太空鳞兽","speakerId":"avg_npc_2040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他跟随从一直驻守在云中餐厅和贵宾接待区，环形廊道是必经之路，但暂时没人发现暗门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，七年前我刚进管理局工作的时候，就算只是从偷渡客裤兜里昧下一个液化源石打火机，都会被古斯塔夫发现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是军人出身，我以为他是过于正直所以故意针对我，后来我才知道，古斯塔夫是嫌我做事不够干净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的做派、话术，甚至这身西装我都学来了。至于成果——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太空鳞兽","speakerId":"avg_npc_2040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一间存放泰拉各地奇珍异宝的“船舱”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比管理局肮脏的储物柜可大得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一边是古斯塔夫，一边是娜斯提，那又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不是七年前的毛头小子了。除非我把罪证送到他们面前，不然他们这辈子都不可能发现我的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到展会开始，上万件展品飞向天空，“秘密”“违规交易”......一切都不重要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到时候所有人都会知道——不是莱茵，也不是特区政府，而是高登·谭农为“螺旋桨天堂”点了一把火。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太空鳞兽","speakerId":"avg_npc_2040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意！监测到泰拉人正在靠近！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么声音？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别炸......底下......万一有人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......花言巧语......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"68_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"一片烟雾之中，高登抬起头，使劲睁开流泪的眼睛，试图看清到底发生了什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个熟悉的人影从碎石和粉尘之中落下，四肢不受控制地挥动——几个小时前才被高登下令通缉的对象，竟然凭空出现在他面前。\n此刻，他们的距离只有九十公分，无数思绪从两人高速运转的大脑中滑过。\n一切似乎都静止了，高登和费尔南慌乱地捕捉对方的表情和眼神，各怀鬼胎，隔空对望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（那群警卫真的说炸就炸啊！不对，这是哪里？为什么我的地图里没有标记这个地方？环形廊道还有暗门？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（高登长官？怎么撞他铳口上了！这是他的圈套？可他为什么一脸惊讶地看着我，表情还那么僵硬？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（墙上的东西，是展品？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（不对！我当初被萨卡兹抓进黑市时，绝对在地摊上见过这种施术装置；还有那边的帽子，那不是萨尔贡墓室里长生军的标配吗......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶......我可能撞进不得了的地方了。现在装没看见，还来得及吗......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（千万别撞到高能源石化合手雷，不然整个浮空舱都会玩儿完的！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（他妈的，自从这个冒牌讲解员闯进园区以来就没有一件好事！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（她到底是莱茵的仇人，还是娜斯提派来的间谍？每次都破坏我的计划，生态园是一次，现在又是一次。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（她在看什么？活性源石风暴的引导信标，还是长生军的巫术头盔？*哥伦比亚粗口*，她认出来了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（让这么一个人抓住我的把柄，指不定她会用这个消息去跟谁交易，要是娜斯提或者古斯塔夫知道了......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"68_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"迟来的重力让费尔南迅速下坠，高登根本来不及抢救任何藏品，只能眼睁睁看着眼前的菲林女孩冲自己砸来。\n两人的距离急速拉近，脑海里闪过的复杂念头全都消失，在撞击到来之前，两人只来得及说出一句话——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登&费尔南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"完了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_249_muesys","aliases":["缪尔赛思"]}]}
